19:T410,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Which public university in Turkey is cheapest?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no reliable universal answer across faculties, cohorts and housing choices. Compare the actual international fee for your programme and the complete cost in that city."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does TR-YÖS admission work at every university?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No single result guarantees a place everywhere. Use each institution’s accepted qualifications, result-validity and programme conditions; taking the exam does not submit university applications."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are private and foundation universities the same term here?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"This guide uses foundation university for the non-state institutions in this comparison. Applicants often search for private universities; use the official institution and programme rules regardless of the search term."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page editorial-page--guide","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/universities-in-turkey-for-international-students/\",\"name\":\"Universities in Turkey for international students\",\"description\":\"Compare public and foundation universities in Turkey, English-taught study routes, admission evidence and the questions to settle before applying.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/universities-in-turkey-for-international-students/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-29\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-29\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/study-planning-1280.webp\",\"caption\":\"Illustrative students comparing study notes and programme inform